1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Third Episode
The Egyptian Adventure
Pyramid Monster

15
00:02:22,963 --> 00:02:25,889
That's why your watch is so important.

16
00:02:25,913 --> 00:02:29,369
Especially in winter, fog rolls over these waters.

17
00:02:29,393 --> 00:02:33,000
If an enemy ship attacked under cover of it, we'd never know.

18
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,053
Days like today are the most dangerous.

19
00:02:35,893 --> 00:02:37,313
What's that?!

20
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:43,139
<i>It's a suspicious ship.</i>

21
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,420
<i>What country is this girl from?</i>

22
00:02:54,870 --> 00:02:56,309
Don't worry, you're safe.

23
00:02:56,333 --> 00:02:57,393
Where are you from?

24
00:02:57,515 --> 00:02:59,120
Why are you wearing those iron rings?

25
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,455
I ran away.

26
00:03:00,479 --> 00:03:03,266
Please, take off these iron rings.

27
00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:04,846
All right.

28
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:08,760
They won't come off.

29
00:03:10,130 --> 00:03:11,800
What on earth is this mark?

30
00:03:11,904 --> 00:03:13,300
It is the mark of sacrifice.

31
00:03:13,605 --> 00:03:17,380
Every year, ten girls wearing these bracelets are sacrificed.

32
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,909
A sacrifice?

33
00:03:18,933 --> 00:03:20,113
How terrible...

34
00:03:23,820 --> 00:03:25,020
Thank you.

35
00:03:25,385 --> 00:03:28,660
Tell me more. Where is your country located?

36
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:32,820
Pursuers!

37
00:03:35,130 --> 00:03:36,466
Please help me escape!

38
00:03:36,665 --> 00:03:38,426
Quick! Hide in that fortress!

39
00:03:50,594 --> 00:03:51,434
This is bad...

40
00:03:58,667 --> 00:04:00,140
What country's soldiers are you?!

41
00:04:01,395 --> 00:04:04,176
Young maiden chosen for the sacrifice, why did you run?!

42
00:04:04,374 --> 00:04:05,440
Your crime is grave!

43
00:04:05,690 --> 00:04:06,756
Make no mistake!

44
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:09,840
I am Princess Sapphire of Silverland!

45
00:04:09,975 --> 00:04:11,110
Don't be ridiculous!

46
00:04:11,440 --> 00:04:14,200
Disguising yourself as a young maiden of this land won't fool anyone!

47
00:04:14,670 --> 00:04:17,166
That bracelet you're wearing is absolute proof!

48
00:04:17,540 --> 00:04:18,743
Don't waste time!

49
00:04:18,767 --> 00:04:20,159
Drag the young maiden away!

50
00:04:23,585 --> 00:04:25,540
Let go! You've got the wrong person!

51
00:05:09,766 --> 00:05:10,660
I'm sick of this!

52
00:05:10,685 --> 00:05:12,319
<i>I'm sick of this.</i>

53
00:05:21,570 --> 00:05:24,020
Are you awake, beautiful maiden?

54
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,393
Who are you...?

55
00:05:27,235 --> 00:05:27,917
Where...

56
00:05:28,634 --> 00:05:29,720
where am I?

57
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,560
Trying to play dumb, are you?

58
00:05:32,033 --> 00:05:33,589
This large port town,

59
00:05:33,613 --> 00:05:37,556
and the great triangular structures beyond the desert...

60
00:05:37,580 --> 00:05:40,920
Everyone in the world knows this place.

61
00:05:43,450 --> 00:05:44,562
The big port...

62
00:05:46,166 --> 00:05:47,520
and the pyramids

63
00:05:48,253 --> 00:05:52,102
So this is Egypt, just like Dr. Uranai told me about!

64
00:05:54,453 --> 00:05:58,116
Yes, this is Egypt's premier city, Alexandria.

65
00:05:58,140 --> 00:06:00,936
And I am the Master of Ceremonies, Morpho.

66
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:01,802
Morpho!

67
00:06:01,933 --> 00:06:02,929
Hey, Morpho!

68
00:06:02,953 --> 00:06:05,480
This is all a case of mistaken identity!

69
00:06:07,075 --> 00:06:08,860
Still trying to play dumb?

70
00:06:09,255 --> 00:06:13,780
Tell me, beautiful maiden, isn't it an honor to be sacrificed?

71
00:06:14,395 --> 00:06:17,680
You were chosen as a sacrifice because you are so beautiful.

72
00:06:19,310 --> 00:06:24,540
Sacrifices appease Osiris, the God of Death, and keep our land at peace!

73
00:06:24,770 --> 00:06:28,220
That's nonsense! A kingdom can't gain peace through sacrifice!

74
00:06:28,221 --> 00:06:33,440
Silence! The god Osiris and Queen Ida demand ten sacrifices!

75
00:06:33,685 --> 00:06:34,505
Ten?!

76
00:06:34,813 --> 00:06:36,089
On the night of the next full moon,

77
00:06:36,113 --> 00:06:39,846
all ten of you beautiful maidens will be sacrificed!

78
00:06:40,969 --> 00:06:43,159
<i>I have to find a way to escape...</i>

79
00:06:46,220 --> 00:06:47,220
Very well.

80
00:06:49,805 --> 00:06:51,740
Goodness, what's wrong?

81
00:06:52,900 --> 00:06:53,928
These iron shackles...

82
00:06:53,952 --> 00:06:57,340
Could you please adjust them so they don't hurt?

83
00:06:57,813 --> 00:06:59,620
That's easily done.

84
00:07:01,910 --> 00:07:03,700
Oh, there we go.

85
00:07:10,113 --> 00:07:12,306
Damn it, taking me for a fool!

86
00:07:13,239 --> 00:07:13,880
There!

87
00:07:23,850 --> 00:07:24,850
Not bad!

88
00:07:26,899 --> 00:07:27,402
Hold it!

89
00:07:32,010 --> 00:07:33,220
Prince Amensis

90
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:38,793
I am Amensis, the late Queen Ida's only son.

91
00:07:41,215 --> 00:07:43,020
Princess Sapphire of Silverland.

92
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:44,996
Princess of Silverland,

93
00:07:45,586 --> 00:07:46,880
I believe your words.

94
00:07:47,445 --> 00:07:51,620
Your noble grace and skill with a sword prove you are no ordinary maiden.

95
00:07:52,035 --> 00:07:54,060
Please, let me go back.

96
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,200
Is something wrong?

97
00:07:57,325 --> 00:08:01,900
Even if it's a case of mistaken identity, I cannot decide your fate on my own.

98
00:08:02,353 --> 00:08:03,000
No!

99
00:08:03,470 --> 00:08:06,575
This kingdom is vast, and I lack authority.

100
00:08:07,286 --> 00:08:10,326
I will call a council to decide. Please wait here until then.

101
00:08:13,585 --> 00:08:14,665
Prince Amensis!

102
00:08:21,359 --> 00:08:23,186
I'm really sick of this!

103
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,292
<i>I know!</i>

104
00:08:29,756 --> 00:08:32,413
Hey, kid, is that parrot good at mimicking people?

105
00:08:32,659 --> 00:08:35,460
<i>Hey kid, is that parrot good at mimicking people?</i>

106
00:08:35,750 --> 00:08:37,400
Can that parrot fly well?

107
00:08:37,969 --> 00:08:39,675
<i>Can that parrot fly well?</i>

108
00:08:40,589 --> 00:08:41,973
It could fly around the world!

109
00:08:42,369 --> 00:08:44,001
<i>...around the world.</i>

110
00:08:44,025 --> 00:08:46,881
That's a bit of an exaggeration.

111
00:08:46,905 --> 00:08:51,533
Listen, go to my kingdom and tell Tink to come help me.

112
00:08:51,825 --> 00:08:52,825
Easy enough!

113
00:08:52,965 --> 00:08:54,306
I'll reward you later.

114
00:08:54,495 --> 00:08:55,995
Which way is your kingdom?

115
00:08:56,020 --> 00:08:56,914
<i>To the north.</i>

116
00:08:56,938 --> 00:08:59,586
Right, fly as fast as you can to the north.

117
00:09:03,205 --> 00:09:04,666
<i>This way.</i>

118
00:09:15,429 --> 00:09:17,940
I'm going to be buried alive along with these people!

119
00:09:19,125 --> 00:09:21,567
Your Highness! Prince Amensis!

120
00:09:21,591 --> 00:09:23,720
Won't you please release me, Sapphire?

121
00:09:24,899 --> 00:09:27,053
Your Highness! What's going to happen to me?

122
00:09:28,629 --> 00:09:31,893
You will be sacrificed as well. It has been decided.

123
00:09:32,659 --> 00:09:33,747
<i>That's absurd...</i>

124
00:09:33,771 --> 00:09:37,320
You are taking the place of the young maiden who fled to your kingdom.

125
00:09:38,359 --> 00:09:38,907
Now then,

126
00:09:38,931 --> 00:09:44,807
you are the sacrifices to be offered to the spirit of the late Queen Ida.

127
00:09:44,831 --> 00:09:47,374
As you know,

128
00:09:47,398 --> 00:09:51,766
Queen Ida was said to be the second most beautiful woman,

129
00:09:51,791 --> 00:09:53,100
 right after Cleopatra.

130
00:09:54,306 --> 00:09:55,820
Even in death,

131
00:09:55,844 --> 00:09:57,867
she retains her youth and beauty,

132
00:09:57,891 --> 00:10:03,440
sleeping mummified deep within the pyramid.

133
00:10:07,246 --> 00:10:11,674
But the mummy's youth and beauty

134
00:10:11,698 --> 00:10:15,400
will fade unless you, the sacrifices, offer yours.

135
00:10:15,765 --> 00:10:16,600
It's just superstition.

136
00:10:17,018 --> 00:10:19,627
To take ten lives every year over something like this...

137
00:10:20,284 --> 00:10:21,279
<i>Superstition?!</i>

138
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:24,860
Highness! As young as you are, do you really believe this?

139
00:10:25,075 --> 00:10:28,300
I'm just believing what Morpho taught me.

140
00:10:28,526 --> 00:10:30,267
I do not lie.

141
00:10:30,291 --> 00:10:34,167
Without a sacrifice, your mother's mummy will hideously decay,

142
00:10:34,191 --> 00:10:38,494
and the curse of Osiris, God of Death, will fall upon the Kingdom of Egypt.

143
00:10:38,518 --> 00:10:39,520
He's lying, Highness!

144
00:10:39,544 --> 00:10:40,580
Stop it!

145
00:10:40,893 --> 00:10:42,694
There's nothing more to say.

146
00:10:42,718 --> 00:10:45,300
You will be sacrificed in five days.

147
00:10:45,324 --> 00:10:49,820
Until then, enjoy yourself in this palace to your heart's content.

148
00:10:55,249 --> 00:10:57,280
<i>I, Sapphire am not going to die like this!</i>

149
00:10:58,244 --> 00:10:59,984
And Tink didn't show up today, either...

150
00:11:28,969 --> 00:11:32,120
Why aren't you crying or trying to run away?

151
00:11:32,420 --> 00:11:34,619
I was chosen because I'm beautiful.

152
00:11:35,465 --> 00:11:37,619
Were you born just to be buried alive?

153
00:11:40,409 --> 00:11:44,520
Listen, we have to escape somehow. If we fight, I know we can make it.

154
00:11:44,858 --> 00:11:48,853
Sapphire... Tink... It's Tink!

155
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:51,098
Prince Amensis...

156
00:11:51,122 --> 00:11:53,140
there is one way to save you.

157
00:11:53,369 --> 00:11:57,220
That is... That is to marry me.

158
00:11:58,180 --> 00:12:01,140
If you marry me, you won't have to die.

159
00:12:03,079 --> 00:12:04,240
Please marry me.

160
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:09,840
I refuse!

161
00:12:11,329 --> 00:12:12,420
Choose someone else!

162
00:12:12,995 --> 00:12:14,960
I, Sapphire, refuse to be the only one saved!

163
00:12:15,185 --> 00:12:16,400
You have only three days left to live.

164
00:12:17,065 --> 00:12:18,380
I'll be awaiting your answer.

165
00:13:14,659 --> 00:13:15,573
<i>Tink.</i>

166
00:13:15,971 --> 00:13:17,500
<i>The news must not have reached you.</i>

167
00:13:25,886 --> 00:13:31,840
Beautiful sacrifices, the night of the full moon has come. Are you prepared?

168
00:13:34,486 --> 00:13:39,572
Great Reaper Osiris, deliver these sacrifices to the realm of the dead!

169
00:13:39,849 --> 00:13:45,460
And transfer their beauty to the mummy of Queen Ida!

170
00:13:45,810 --> 00:13:49,380
Oh, Queen Ida, remain beautiful forever!

171
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:53,853
Oh, Queen Ida, remain young forever!

172
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:56,113
Stop this at once!

173
00:13:56,689 --> 00:13:59,966
Dead people can't become young or beautiful!

174
00:14:00,399 --> 00:14:02,240
Fear Osiris, the god of death!

175
00:14:02,660 --> 00:14:03,906
There is no god of blood!

176
00:14:04,225 --> 00:14:07,453
What? Has she gone mad with fear of being sacrificed?!

177
00:14:07,935 --> 00:14:09,506
Men, take the sacrifices away!

178
00:14:09,780 --> 00:14:12,059
To the pyramid where Queen Ida slumbers!

179
00:14:17,960 --> 00:14:18,960
Wait.

180
00:14:19,474 --> 00:14:21,800
Sapphire, please hear my request.

181
00:14:22,125 --> 00:14:26,300
Take this ring and become my wife, and you will be saved.

182
00:14:29,900 --> 00:14:30,900
I refuse.

183
00:14:42,539 --> 00:14:43,700
Hey, go check it out.

184
00:14:54,651 --> 00:14:56,120
Sapphire, Sapphire.

185
00:14:56,916 --> 00:14:57,595
Sapphire.

186
00:14:57,939 --> 00:14:58,983
Tink?

187
00:14:59,573 --> 00:15:00,483
Tink?

188
00:15:00,507 --> 00:15:02,500
Where are you?

189
00:15:05,489 --> 00:15:10,180
Sapphire, listen to me. Become my wife, Sapphire.

190
00:15:11,063 --> 00:15:12,072
Prince Amensis...

191
00:15:12,309 --> 00:15:13,919
I don't want to see you die!

192
00:15:14,649 --> 00:15:16,020
No matter how many times you ask, I refuse!

193
00:15:17,180 --> 00:15:20,673
I am not the kind of girl who would be happy saving only myself!

194
00:15:34,653 --> 00:15:37,580
<i>Once we're trapped inside... It's all over.</i>

195
00:15:47,443 --> 00:15:49,195
Sapphire!

196
00:15:49,839 --> 00:15:50,693
Tink!

197
00:15:51,340 --> 00:15:52,340
Hmm? Who's there?

198
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:53,620
Sapphire!

199
00:15:55,899 --> 00:15:57,933
Tink! Over here!

200
00:15:58,020 --> 00:15:58,546
There!

201
00:16:07,216 --> 00:16:09,079
<i>This is awful!</i>

202
00:16:24,900 --> 00:16:25,986
Tink!

203
00:16:33,029 --> 00:16:35,380
Sapphire, I am a coward.

204
00:16:35,575 --> 00:16:38,700
I don't have the courage to face Morpho or Osiris to protect you.

205
00:16:39,249 --> 00:16:40,160
Sapphire.

206
00:17:36,699 --> 00:17:39,826
Carry out my will as you move forward! Understood?!

207
00:17:53,829 --> 00:17:55,660
Fools, even after I warned them!

208
00:17:56,010 --> 00:17:59,440
The pyramid is full of traps to ward off thieves!

209
00:18:13,039 --> 00:18:16,773
O Osiris, God of Death, accept this sacrifice!

210
00:18:28,333 --> 00:18:29,780
Farewell!

211
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,833
That shall be your grave!

212
00:18:40,799 --> 00:18:43,760
Gods, save us! I'm so scared! I'm afraid to die!

213
00:18:45,174 --> 00:18:48,239
Are you girls all beauty and no courage?

214
00:18:49,109 --> 00:18:54,060
Come on, cheer up and be brave. There must be an exit somewhere.

215
00:18:54,475 --> 00:18:56,110
Since the pyramid is a giant maze,

216
00:18:56,134 --> 00:18:58,180
there's bound to be at least one opening.

217
00:19:02,366 --> 00:19:03,540
<i>Oh, this is awful...</i>

218
00:19:05,460 --> 00:19:06,726
Help me!

219
00:19:10,889 --> 00:19:12,860
We really don't need crocodiles now!

220
00:19:16,341 --> 00:19:17,400
It's a pincer attack!

221
00:19:21,099 --> 00:19:22,546
Thank you very much.

222
00:19:25,919 --> 00:19:27,140
Thank you so very much.

223
00:19:28,439 --> 00:19:30,440
I bet even this kid will sell.

224
00:19:30,554 --> 00:19:31,901
Maybe around 300 yen?

225
00:19:31,925 --> 00:19:33,620
Boss, that's awful!

226
00:19:34,279 --> 00:19:35,700
300 yen? What do you mean?

227
00:19:35,884 --> 00:19:40,840
We're slave traders. Even you can sell for 300 yen. Have some confidence!

228
00:19:41,699 --> 00:19:42,940
You're going to sell me?

229
00:19:43,214 --> 00:19:45,599
No! No! No! No! No!

230
00:19:46,269 --> 00:19:49,086
No! No! No! No!

231
00:19:49,189 --> 00:19:52,040
I have to go save Sapphire!

232
00:19:52,220 --> 00:19:54,853
I said no! Let go of me!

233
00:19:55,309 --> 00:19:57,213
I said no! No! No! No!

234
00:20:05,389 --> 00:20:06,299
Nothing...

235
00:20:07,869 --> 00:20:09,919
I thought there'd be a secret exit somewhere...

236
00:20:10,739 --> 00:20:14,320
It's no use. We've been captured by Osiris, the god of death.

237
00:20:14,373 --> 00:20:16,980
Osiris, sacrifices... it's all just superstition.

238
00:20:17,389 --> 00:20:20,720
Dying won't make the mummies look any prettier.

239
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:23,840
Don't say that! Lord Osiris's curse is terrifying!

240
00:20:24,689 --> 00:20:26,560
There's no such thing as a curse.

241
00:20:35,620 --> 00:20:37,980
M-M-M-Mummy!

242
00:20:57,954 --> 00:21:00,886
A secret exit! Escape through there! Come on!

243
00:21:12,800 --> 00:21:13,980
Get up! Hurry!

244
00:21:18,449 --> 00:21:20,613
It's the exit! Hurry!

245
00:21:34,453 --> 00:21:35,246
Morfo!

246
00:21:36,599 --> 00:21:37,869
Hey, slave trader,

247
00:21:37,893 --> 00:21:41,523
this batch of female slaves gave us a hard time, all because of this one.

248
00:21:41,548 --> 00:21:42,739
A slaver trader...

249
00:21:43,939 --> 00:21:46,939
Quite a lineup of beauties this year.

250
00:21:47,539 --> 00:21:48,706
Give me a good price for them.

251
00:21:48,730 --> 00:21:49,200
Sure.

252
00:21:49,259 --> 00:21:50,059
I see.

253
00:21:50,083 --> 00:21:52,279
Every year, claiming they were sacrifices, you gathered

254
00:21:52,303 --> 00:21:54,666
beautiful maidens from across the land and kidnapped them.

255
00:21:54,690 --> 00:21:57,120
You were selling them off to slave traders!

256
00:21:58,260 --> 00:22:00,473
The Reaper of Osiris, preserving the mummy's beauty...

257
00:22:00,497 --> 00:22:03,713
I set it all up brilliantly, if I say so myself.

258
00:22:04,653 --> 00:22:06,040
Tie up the slaves!

259
00:22:06,360 --> 00:22:07,360
Let me go!

260
00:22:14,039 --> 00:22:16,500
Stuffing me into a mustard pot is so cruel!

261
00:22:18,880 --> 00:22:19,880
Sapphire!

262
00:22:21,479 --> 00:22:23,580
If I'm caught, I can't save Sapphire.

263
00:22:24,059 --> 00:22:26,246
What should I do... what should I do...?

264
00:22:26,270 --> 00:22:26,913
 I know!

265
00:22:29,119 --> 00:22:32,946
Heavenly Father, forgive me for picking on these camels.

266
00:22:33,279 --> 00:22:34,960
Sorry, Rakuda-san!

267
00:22:42,549 --> 00:22:44,086
What's going on here!?

268
00:22:46,060 --> 00:22:47,060
Tink!

269
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:48,680
Sapphire!

270
00:22:50,609 --> 00:22:51,820
Prepare yourself, Morpho!

271
00:22:57,100 --> 00:22:58,261
Wait!

272
00:23:07,015 --> 00:23:08,055
Wait!

273
00:23:21,413 --> 00:23:22,413
How do you like that?

274
00:23:24,219 --> 00:23:27,700
Morpho, now is the time to stand up to superstition!

275
00:23:30,874 --> 00:23:31,833
How dare you!

276
00:23:47,386 --> 00:23:50,260
I feel like I've grown stronger thanks to you.

277
00:23:50,409 --> 00:23:51,420
Thank you, Sapphire.

278
00:23:53,789 --> 00:23:57,540
We'll do our best to make our country just as great as yours.

